{"updated":"2026-11-24T10:17+00:00","warnings":[{"event":"Yellow rain warning","level":"yellow","headline":"Heavy rain may cause some flooding and travel disruption on Tuesday: UPDATED","description":"Information on update: Warning start time brought forward to account for heavier rain arriving slightly earlier than previously forecast. A band of heavy rain is likely to become slow-moving across parts of Cornwall and the Isles of Scilly during Tuesday before slowly easing overnight. 30-40 mm of rain is likely to fall quite widely and follows heavy rainfall on Sunday. There is a chance that heavy rain persists over some locations, most likely western Cornwall, with in excess of 60 mm possible here.","impacts":["Spray and flooding could lead to difficult driving conditions and some road closures","Where flooding occurs, delays or cancellations to train and bus services are possible","There is a small chance that homes and businesses could be flooded, causing damage to some buildings","There is a small chance that some communities will become cut off by flooded roads","There is a slight chance of power cuts and loss of other services to some homes and businesses"],"onset":"2026-11-24T08:01:41+00:00","expires":"2026-11-24T23:59:59+00:00","areas":[{"name":"South West England","polygons":[[[49.864,-6.466],[49.857,-6.465],[49.851,-6.463],[49.846,-6.46],[49.843,-6.455],[49.84,-6.45],[49.837,-6.443],[49.834,-6.436],[49.832,-6.427],[49.83,-6.418],[49.828,-6.409],[49.827,-6.399],[49.826,-6.389],[49.826,-6.379],[49.826,-6.369],[49.826,-6.359],[49.827,-6.35],[49.828,-6.342],[49.83,-6.332],[49.833,-6.322],[49.837,-6.312],[49.842,-6.301],[49.847,-6.291],[49.853,-6.281],[49.859,-6.271],[49.866,-6.261],[49.872,-6.252],[49.879,-6.243],[49.886,-6.234],[49.893,-6.227],[49.9,-6.22],[49.906,-6.214],[49.911,-6.209],[49.917,-6.204],[49.923,-6.199],[49.929,-6.195],[49.936,-6.191],[49.942,-6.187],[49.949,-6.184],[49.955,-6.181],[49.961,-6.179],[49.967,-6.178],[49.972,-6.177],[49.977,-6.178],